{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17738","headline":"观打球有作 · 杨巨源","name":"观打球有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亲扫球场如砥平，龙骧骤马晓光晴。\n入门百拜瞻雄势，动地三军唱好声。\n玉勒回时沾赤汗，花鬉分处拂红缨。\n欲令四海氛烟静，杖底纤尘不敢生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}